'''James Frederick Campen''' (born June 11, 1964) is an American professional [[American football|football]] coach and former player who currently serves as the  offensive line coach for the [[Pittsburgh Steelers]] of the [[National Football League]] (NFL). He played as a [[Center (American football)|center]] for the [[New Orleans Saints]] and [[Green Bay Packers]].<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.pro-football-reference.com/players/C/CampJa21.htm|title=James Campen Stats|website=Pro-Football-Reference.com|language=en|access-date=2020-04-29}}</ref><ref>[https://www.packers.com/team/coaches-roster/james-campen James Campen - Green Bay Packers] {{Webarchive|url=https://web.archive.org/web/20180913185427/https://www.packers.com/team/coaches-roster/james-campen |date=September 13, 2018 }} Retrieved September 13, 2018.</ref>
